{"id":"5937","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5937_main_cumulus-congestus-altocumulogenitus-and-altocumulus-floccus-virga_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>图中，垂直厚度巨大的堡状高积云已演变为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">高云底浓积云</span>，可看到它在远处。由于这一演变，可将其称为高积云性。在图片的前景中，从堡状云中落下厚<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">幡状尾</span>，并进入下方干燥空气中蒸发（探测中可见）。由于这一过程，堡状云正演变为絮状云。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Michael Bruhn","location":"澳大利亚，维多利亚州，布罗德梅多斯","latitude":"纬度: 37° 41' 24'' S","longitude":"经度: 144° 56' 50'' E","date":"09 May 2012 0841 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 8, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: P.9.14","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.9.14"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5937_syn_cumulus-congestus-altocumulogenitus-and-altocumulus-floccus-virga_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>当地时间10:00的天气图显示出1024 hPa高压，中心在澳大利亚新南威尔士州北部上空。伴随南大洋深低压的相当弱的冷锋正在抵近图片拍摄位置（红箭头所示）。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 澳大利亚联邦2012，澳大利亚气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5937_upper_cumulus-congestus-altocumulogenitus-and-altocumulus-floccus-virga_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>0000 UTC在澳大利亚维多利亚州墨尔本机场（WMO 94866）的探测显示出在相当弱的冷锋之前的条件不稳定性，冷锋正在抵近照片拍摄位置，在正衰减的夜间辐射逆温上方。应注意在大约700-550 hPa之间中间层的湿带。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5947_main_cumulus-congestus-altocumulogenitus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>浓积云是从堡状高积云发展而来</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Michael Bruhn","location":"澳大利亚，布罗德梅多斯VIC 3047","latitude":"纬度: 37° 41' 24'' S","longitude":"经度: 144° 56' 50'' E","date":"27 November 2012 1324 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东东北","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 8, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.9.14","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.9.14"}]}]}